  "description": {
    "en": "Kirschbaum Xplosive Speed is a soft pentagonal co-polyester string pre-stretched using Thermo Fusion Technology (TFT). Designed to reduce tension loss and improve durability, it combines explosive speed with exceptional topspin and slice potential. The five-sided profile increases ball bite while the softer construction provides excellent comfort for aggressive players with powerful swings.",
    "zh": "Kirschbaum Xplosive Speed 是一款采用 Thermo Fusion Technology（TFT 热融合技术）预拉伸处理的柔和型五边形共聚酯球线。它能够有效降低掉磅并延长使用寿命，同时兼具爆发速度、强烈上旋与切削能力。五边形截面提升咬球效果，柔和配方则带来更舒适的击球体验，非常适合挥拍速度快、力量充足的现代进攻型球员。"
  },

